                                "example_id": "528627b7-5db1-44a1-b084-5cdf1b015dcd",
                                "sense_id": "8eac4203-615f-36b3-89d5-2b1f6c97a867",
                                "text": "I meane hereafter to make a more liberall discourse of them in the forevouched booke of their liues, to be opened at large with all suche worthye actions as they haue performed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "08b110a4-9520-417d-96eb-13d6e8189a1b",
                                "sense_id": "8eac4203-615f-36b3-89d5-2b1f6c97a867",
                                "text": "Sure her offence Must be of such unnatural degree, That monsters it, or your forevouched affection Fall into taint,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed81ab80-2104-4633-9f1f-70f15839b0db",
                                "sense_id": "8eac4203-615f-36b3-89d5-2b1f6c97a867",
                                "text": "As a prophecy, it wins our deep admiration, in acarrying far back the distince representment and hope of the forevouched Messiah, having been delivered fourteen hundred years before, He came, in whom this and all ancient pre-announcements are fulfilled and remote antiquity, in such a record, is a high test of the genuineness of seership."
                            }
                        ]
